# Ticket 161 r1 probe bench: what stays OUT of the repository.
#
# runs/  - generated fixture roots. Byte-reproducible from the committed
#          bench.sh (`sh bench.sh all`), and they deliberately contain
#          unparseable .go files: committed, those would turn CI's
#          `gofmt (gofumpt)` step red for a sample that is supposed to be
#          measured, not linted. So they are generated and ignored.
# bin/   - the scanner binary this bench builds out of tools/d22scan to run 27
#          cells fast (`*.exe` is already ignored at the root; named here so the
#          rule does not depend on the extension).
runs/
bin/
